    "description": "Rhythm ERP Common Settings module.\n\nSetup: set base_url, token, tenant_id in your Postman environment.\n\nModules with live FK resolution (UOM Conversion, Tax Authority, Tax Rate, Vehicle Master) use pre-request scripts to fetch IDs from the ERP automatically — same flow as the batch script FkResolver. No manual ID lookup needed."
  },
